# Case: Diagnostic settings and safe local export
# Mode: process
# Purpose: Verify persistent logging, bounded overrides, telemetry controls and safe diagnostic export through production processes.
# Steps:
#   Drive the production Desktop binding against unicd, restart, and inspect an archive made by the production CLI.
# Expected:
